OL,3,AMost migrant arrivals by small boat in
OL,4,Asingle day of 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FWednesday was the busiest day of 2026
OL,7,Fso far for small boat crossings,
OL,8,Faccording to Home Office figures.
OL,10,FA total of 781 people arrived across 10
OL,11,Fseparate boats, bringing the cumulative
OL,12,Ftotal for the year so far to 18,565.
OL,14,FThe total is 42% lower than up to the
OL,15,Fequivalent date in 2025.
OL,17,FWednesday's figure was the highest
OL,18,Fdaily total since 803 people arrived on
OL,19,F20 December 2025.
